 "description": "The Figaro BENETEAU 3 is the first production foiling one-design monohull ever to be designed. A distillation of technology and innovation, it results from a collaboration between group BENETEAU’s best experts and the Van Peteghem Lauriot-Prévost (VPLP) office, the architects of the two last boats to win the Vendée Globe.\nThe prototype has been tested and the production of the boat has been launched. It will enter the ISO/World Sailing design category A.",
